# Field-tested Reference Books: A Survey of What Has Worked Best.

**Authors:** Alloway, Cathy, And Others

## Abstract
Reviews 25 reference sources published in 1987 or 1988 in several formats--books, CD-ROM products, online databases, and government documents--and recommended by librarians. Materials in the following areas are included: general reference; business; science and technology; fine arts and literature; history; medicine and health; and social sciences and humanities. (MES)

**Source:** https://eric.ed.gov/?id=EJ389331

